#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:6
msgid "# execute_code Multi-Runtime Design"
msgstr "# execute_code 多运行时设计"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:8
msgid ""
"> One tool, multiple runtimes; default Node.js, extend Python / Deno on "
"demand."
msgstr "> 一个工具、多种运行时；默认 Node.js，按需扩展 Python / Deno。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:10
msgid "## Background"
msgstr "## 背景"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:12
msgid ""
"`execute_code` was hardcoded to Node.js, but the tool schema exposed only "
"`\"Run code\"` to the LLM, causing models to frequently write Python and "
"fail execution."
msgstr ""
"`execute_code` 原先硬编码 Node.js，但 tool schema 对 LLM 只暴露 `\"Run "
"code\"`，导致模型频繁写入 Python 而执行失败。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:14
msgid "Goals:"
msgstr "改造目标："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:19
msgid ""
"**Clear semantics** — LLM knows which language to write and which runtime to "
"pick"
msgstr "**语义清晰** — LLM 明确知道该写什么语言、该选哪个 runtime"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:19
msgid "**Default Bun** — same stack as FreeAnima, preferred for TS/JS snippets"
msgstr "**默认 Bun** — 与逸灵风同栈，TS/JS 片段首选"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:19
msgid "**Extensible** — reserve Python, Deno, enable progressively via config"
msgstr "**可扩展** — 预留 Python、Deno，按配置逐步启用"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:19
msgid "**Division from terminal** — structured subprocess vs shell"
msgstr "**与 terminal 分工** — 结构化子进程 vs shell"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:21
msgid "## Division from terminal"
msgstr "## 与 terminal 的分工"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| | `execute_code` | `terminal` |\n"
"| - | -------------- | ---------- |\n"
"| Execution | No shell, fixed runtime | shell=true |\n"
"| Best for | Short scripts, data processing, logic checks | System commands, pipes, git, long tasks |\n"
"| Output | 50KB cap, controllable timeout | Same limits but more freedom |\n"
"| Security | Smaller attack surface (no shell injection) | Larger attack surface |\n"
msgstr ""
"|          | `execute_code`             | `terminal`                    |\n"
"| -------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| 执行方式 | 无 shell，固定运行时       | shell=true                    |\n"
"| 适合     | 短脚本、数据处理、逻辑验证 | 系统命令、管道、git、长期任务 |\n"
"| 输出     | 50KB 上限，超时可控        | 同样有限制但更自由            |\n"
"| 安全     | 攻击面小（无 shell 注入）  | 攻击面较大                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:30
msgid ""
"Python batch jobs should use `execute_code(runtime=\"python\")`, not "
"`python3 -c \"...\"` in terminal."
msgstr ""
"Python 批处理应走 `execute_code(runtime=\"python\")`，而非 `python3 -c \"..."
"\"` 塞进 terminal。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:32
msgid "## API"
msgstr "## API"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"execute_code({\n"
"  code: string,           // source\n"
"  runtime?: \"bun\" | \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\",  // default bun\n"
"  timeout?: number,       // seconds, default 300, max 600\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"execute_code({\n"
"  code: string,           // 源码\n"
"  runtime?: \"bun\" | \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\",  // 默认 bun\n"
"  timeout?: number,       // 秒，默认 300，上限 600\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:42
msgid "### LLM-Visible Description (Principles)"
msgstr "### LLM 可见描述（原则）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:45
msgid ""
"Top-level `description` is LLM's sole source of truth (flat JSON Schema, no "
"nested wrapper)"
msgstr "顶层 `description` 即 LLM 唯一真相源（扁平 JSON Schema，无嵌套包装）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:45
msgid ""
"State default runtime, each runtime's language, alternatives when runtime "
"disabled"
msgstr "明确默认 runtime、各 runtime 语言、未启用时的替代方案"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:47
msgid "## Runtime Registry"
msgstr "## 运行时注册表"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"interface CodeRuntime {\n"
"  id: \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\";\n"
"  enabled: boolean;\n"
"  extension: string; // .mts / .py / .ts\n"
"  preamble?: string; // bootstrap before writing file\n"
"  command: string[]; // spawn command and args (last item is file path placeholder)\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"interface CodeRuntime {\n"
"  id: \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\";\n"
"  enabled: boolean;\n"
"  extension: string; // .mts / .py / .ts\n"
"  preamble?: string; // 写入文件前的 bootstrap\n"
"  command: string[]; // spawn 命令与参数（末项为文件路径占位）\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| runtime | command | file | preamble | status |\n"
"| ------- | ------- | ---- | -------- | ------ |\n"
"| **bun** | `bun` (`Bun.spawn`) | `.ts` | common `node:fs` imports etc. | ✅ implemented |\n"
"| **nodejs** | `node --experimental-strip-types` | `.mts` | common `node:fs` imports etc. | ✅ implemented |\n"
"| **python** | `python3` | `.py` | optional `os`/`pathlib` | 🔲 reserved |\n"
"| **deno** | `deno run --allow-read=...` | `.ts` | Deno stdlib | 🔲 reserved |\n"
msgstr ""
"| runtime    | 命令                              | 文件   | preamble                | 状态      |\n"
"| ---------- | --------------------------------- | ------ | ----------------------- | --------- |\n"
"| **bun**    | `bun`（`Bun.spawn`）              | `.ts`  | `node:fs` 等常用 import | ✅ 已实现 |\n"
"| **nodejs** | `node --experimental-strip-types` | `.mts` | `node:fs` 等常用 import | ✅ 已实现 |\n"
"| **python** | `python3`                         | `.py`  | 可选 `os`/`pathlib`     | 🔲 预留   |\n"
"| **deno**   | `deno run --allow-read=...`       | `.ts`  | Deno 标准库             | 🔲 预留   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:66
msgid "### Phase Plan"
msgstr "### 阶段计划"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Phase | Content | Status |\n"
"| ----- | ------- | ------ |\n"
"| **P0** (current) | Flat schema + `runtime` param + bun/nodejs enabled | ✅ implemented |\n"
"| **P1–P4** | python / config toggles / deno / credential injection | see [#40](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/40) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 阶段           | 内容                                           | 状态                                                           |\n"
"| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **P0**（当前） | 扁平 schema + `runtime` 参数 + bun/nodejs 启用 | ✅ 已实现                                                      |\n"
"| **P1–P4**      | python / 配置开关 / deno / credential 注入     | 见 [#40](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/40) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:73
msgid "## Configuration (P2 Reserved)"
msgstr "## 配置（P2 预留）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:87
#, no-wrap
