"    python:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"      command: python3\n"
"    deno:\n"
"      enabled: false\n"
"      command: deno\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```yaml\n"
"execute_code:\n"
"  default_runtime: bun\n"
"  runtimes:\n"
"    nodejs:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"    python:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"      command: python3\n"
"    deno:\n"
"      enabled: false\n"
"      command: deno\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:89
msgid "Disabled runtime returns:"
msgstr "未启用的 runtime 返回："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:93
msgid ""
"```json { \"error\": \"runtime 'python' not enabled; available: nodejs\" } "
"```"
msgstr ""
"```json { \"error\": \"runtime 'python' 尚未启用；当前可用: nodejs\" } ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:95
msgid "## Execution Flow"
msgstr "## 执行流程"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"LLM calls execute_code(code, runtime?)\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  Resolve runtime (default nodejs)\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  Lookup registry → enabled?\n"
"        │ no ──→ {\"error\": \"...\"}\n"
"        ▼ yes\n"
"  mkdtemp → write preamble + code → spawn\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  Merge stdout/stderr; non-zero exit → JSON { output, exit_code }\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  Clean temp files\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"LLM 调用 execute_code(code, runtime?)\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  解析 runtime（默认 nodejs）\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  查注册表 → enabled?\n"
"        │ no ──→ {\"error\": \"...\"}\n"
"        ▼ yes\n"
"  mkdtemp → 写 preamble + code → spawn\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  stdout/stderr 合并；非零 exit → JSON { output, exit_code }\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"  清理临时文件\n"
"```\n"

