msgstr "**不**根据代码内容自动猜测 runtime（避免误判）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:123
msgid "## Credential Injection (P4, Issue #40)"
msgstr "## credential 注入（P4，Issue #40）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:125
msgid ""
"ARCHITECTURE specifies `credential(path)` available in `execute_code` "
