#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:127
msgid "Suggested unified multi-runtime approach:"
msgstr "多 runtime 统一方案建议："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:131
msgid ""
"Parent process resolves `credential(\"...\")` calls in code before spawn (or "
"explicit params)"
msgstr "父进程在 spawn 前解析代码中的 `credential(\"...\")` 调用（或显式参数）"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:131
msgid "Inject via environment: `ANIMA_CRED_<PATH>` (path escaped)"
msgstr "通过环境变量注入：`ANIMA_CRED_<PATH>`（路径转义）"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:131
msgid "Each runtime preamble provides same-name helper reading env"
msgstr "各 runtime preamble 提供同名 helper 读 env"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:133
msgid "Do not call pass CLI inside each runtime."
msgstr "不在各 runtime 内直接调 pass CLI。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:135
msgid "## Tool Schema Flattening"
msgstr "## Tool Schema 扁平化"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:137
msgid "FreeAnima local tools use standard OpenAI shape:"
msgstr "逸灵风本地工具统一为 OpenAI 标准形态："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"registerTool({\n"
"  name: \"execute_code\",\n"
"  description: \"……full description LLM sees……\",\n"
"  parameters: {\n"
"    type: \"object\",\n"
"    properties: { … },\n"
"    required: […],\n"
"  },\n"
"  handler: …,\n"
"});\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"registerTool({\n"
"  name: \"execute_code\",\n"
"  description: \"……LLM 看到的完整说明……\",\n"
"  parameters: {\n"
"    type: \"object\",\n"
"    properties: { … },\n"
"    required: […],\n"
"  },\n"
"  handler: …,\n"
"});\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/execute-code-runtimes.md:152
msgid ""
"Forbidden: nested `{ name, description, parameters: { … } }` wrapper; "
"`openaiFunctionSchema` maps top-level fields directly."
msgstr ""
"禁止 `{ name, description, parameters: { … } }` 嵌套包装；"
"`openaiFunctionSchema` 直接映射顶层字段。"

